  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ombudsman/DEMI</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Women Indigenous Human Rights DEMI, Global Program - Women Human Rights/DEMI</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;det &#xe4;mnar st&#xe4;rka den interna kapaciteten hos DEMI f&#xf6;r att DEMI ska kunna fullg&#xf6;ra sitt mandat avseende fr&#xe4;mja och f&#xf6;rsvara kvinnors      m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter, genom att ge legal och psykologisk hj&#xe4;lp till  kvinnor av urfolksb&#xf6;rd vars m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter har kr&#xe4;nkts.        Insatsen kommer att genomf&#xf6;ras i 12 av Guatemals l&#xe4;n.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The support aims to strengthen internal capacity of DEMI in order to  fulfil its mandate of promotion and defence of women&apos;s human rights.  The program supports the implementation of DEMI&apos;s overall program,    providing legal and psycological assistance to indigenous women whose human rights have been violated.  The program will be implemented in  12 regions of the country.</narrative>
  </description>
